      "options": {
        "mode": "markdown",
        "content": "### Panels 5 to 8\n\nThe Kafka Graph combines traffic into and out of `kafka`. Max shows the peak rate in the time range.\n\nThe traffic Sankey uses server-side cluster, namespace, and service labels. External services without those labels do not appear.\n\nThe cross-cluster Chord compares client and server clusters.\n\nThe parallel-edge Graph groups by `connection_type`. Its legend gives each connection type a unique edge name."
      },
      "transparent": true
    },
